/**
 * Cold-email relay PAUSE (mkt-040).
 *
 * A persisted admin setting (`cold_email_relay_paused`, default "true") that
 * blocks every cold-email campaign send until an admin explicitly resumes. It is
 * deliberately independent of the master switch (`cold_email_sending_enabled`):
 * prod already has sending enabled, so a default-paused flag in code is what stops
 * the relay on deploy WITHOUT editing any production row or queued send.
 *
 * Fail-safe by construction: ONLY the literal string "false" means "not paused".
 * A missing row falls back to the default ("true"); a DB error reads as paused.
 *
